            '<div class="interpretation-box insig-box">Set ALL_INDIA_RAINFALL_RESOURCE_ID and '
            'ALL_INDIA_RAINFALL_API_KEY to enable the century‑scale national monsoon context panel.</div>',
            unsafe_allow_html=True,
