            Ask MandiIQ <span style="font-size:1.2rem;">🧠</span>
          </h2>
          <p style="color:#7e7e7e;font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            Ask a procurement question in plain English. Answers are grounded in live
